# .github/CODEOWNERS
# Remediation: R-13
#
# Enforces review requirements per directory and file type.
# All rules are additive — a file matching multiple patterns requires
# approval from ALL matching owners.
#
# Format: pattern   @user-or-team
# Patterns are evaluated in order; last match wins for the default reviewer,
# but GitHub shows ALL matching owners as required reviewers.
#
# Note: This repo is personal (zrlopez), not org-owned.
# If moved to a GitHub org, replace @zrlopez with @org/team slugs.
